			"notes": "### What's new in version 1.4.1:\n1. Fixed the issue that the hand accessory slot could not be used\n2. Optimized the mana recovery mechanism\n3. The relevant settings of mana value can be modified in the configuration sheet on the mod page (I forgot to write out the content of the last update)\n4. There are instructions for mana value to be set:\n/mana get [player] # to see the player's mana\n/mana set <player> <amount> # Sets the player's mana\n/mana add <player> <amount> # Increases the player's mana\n/mana setmax <player> <amount> # Sets the player's maximum mana\n5. Fixed the Moonlight Sword skill causing the game to crash"
