			"notes": "### What's new in version 1.4:\n1. New weapons and armor added: Magic Sword, Chaos Blade, Demon Blade, Royal Greatsword, Helios Staff, Ember Shatterer, Ender Crystal Tool, Emerald Tool, Ender Crystal Set, Emerald Set\n2. Added mana mechanic (some weapon skills will consume mana)\n3. Added new items: Mana Vial, Enchanted Ender Crystal Apple, Enchanted Mana Crystal Apple, Enchanted Amethyst Apple, Some Ore Powder\n4. Added new debuffs: Ice, Stun\n5. Updated some crafting tables and inventory tabs\n6. Added 5 new accessories to the Curios Accessory Module: Eye of the Sun God, Core of the Fire God, Ender Belt, Ring of Life, and Lava Necklace\n7. Add new entities: Zombie Miners, Skull Miners, Mystery Traders\n8. Add functional blocks: Pulverizer (the functional blocks you try to make are test items that are currently only available through commands, maybe some functional blocks will be added in the future)\n9. Add French, Spanish, Portuguese, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Turkish (all of which may be incomplete or incorrect)"
